  "2026-10-22T12:12:20.701Z",codex-agent,"PR 147 has one unresolved thread, PRRT_kwDOSZp3U86vD-RB; the latest CodeRabbit review has no Outside diff range section. Verified main 43c733ded9097773009284e1dfa3481829a45b06: release:check runs changelog:check with --date-from-version and verify:release-publish-attestation. The audit incorrectly names a version-date verifier. Correct the existing item comment and close reason through pinned CLI mutations; preserve all existing history bytes and original delivered status. The other six reconciliation verdicts match the main workflows, merged certification b3c8da4, and release v2026.10.20. Tracker-only evidence replaces behavioral code reverts. Baseline pm health exits 0 with ok=false due solely to extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew:2026.10.15:2026.10.22:pm-github; no dependency or global extension change is in scope."
  "2026-10-22T12:13:56.133Z",codex-agent,"Evidence/revert proof: the linked 18-assertion audit reads the release scripts and all seven generator invocations from main 43c733ded9097773009284e1dfa3481829a45b06. With AUDIT_BEFORE=1 it reads the original PR 01715e9 record and exits 1 at the incorrect audit wording; with the corrected current record it passes 18/18. This is a read-only before/after comparison, with no history rewrite or implementation revert. Self-review found the same inaccurate claim in the close reason and PR body; both are corrected. Verified all 75 pre-existing history streams preserve the exact original byte prefix. npm ci passed with 0 vulnerabilities; npm run build passed and committed dist files are identical."
  "2026-10-22T12:15:20.593Z",codex-agent,"Final verification: node_modules/.bin/pm test pm-starter-ubt7 --run --progress --only-last passed 1/1 linked command with 18/18 assertions and no skips. Baseline read using AUDIT_BEFORE=1 failed as expected; current record passed. npm ci and npm run build passed, 0 audit vulnerabilities, dist unchanged. npm run changelog:full and npm run changelog:check passed. node_modules/.bin/pm health --json --output-budget unbounded exited 0 with 9/10 checks ok; ok=false remains solely the pre-existing extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew:2026.10.15:2026.10.22:pm-github. git diff --check passed. No timeout or retry was needed. Existing linked-test result tracking is disabled, so results are recorded here. Regenerate and recheck changelog after releasing this claim. Review item stays in_progress for orchestrator verification; existing delivered item stays closed. No source change, thread reply or resolution, merge, or release."
